      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Mint a new name per look (Pill/Tag/Chip)\n• Restate an atom's styles (strokeWidth:4 again)\n• Wrong mark shape (square Badge, round Swatch)\n• Huge empty cards, copy jammed in a corner, label≠look",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
