      "text": "Tokens → Atoms(12) → Variants(recolor/stroke) → Molecules(Callout/Card formulas) → Organisms(Zone/Flow/Rail…)\nNew need? Ask: = existing atom + Pair swap?  Yes → variant; No → add an atom.",
